+- Focused JVM command: `clojure -M:test -n dao.stream.remote-channel-test -n yin.repl.connect-test -n yin.repl.serve-test -n yin.repl.serve-connect-wire-test` — **64 tests, 412 assertions, zero failures/errors**.
