+- Changed-file cljstyle — **exit 2**, one file flagged (R4); no formatting mutation performed.
+- Node: first attempt failed before tests because Java 17 could not load a compiler requiring class version 65 (Java 21). Retried with installed Java 21; result recorded below when complete.
